      ↓
⚙️ Preprocess & Engineer Features
      ↓
🤖 Train Model
      ↓
📏 Evaluate Model
      ↓
🔧 Tune Hyperparameters
      ↓
💾 Save Model
      ↓
🚀 Deploy Model
```

