## ⭐ Goal

The goal of this module is to move from **basic machine learning concepts** to building complete, practical ML projects.

```text
Beginner
   ↓
Python & Data
   ↓
Machine Learning
   ↓
Model Evaluation
   ↓
Advanced ML
   ↓
Deployment
   ↓
🚀 ML Engineer
```

